      "reason": "Narrow imports bind PM config/settings/private secrets/environment/attachments/document text/history instead of t3 application or SQL services. Original account/config/catalog/native protocol/install/token refresh/fork/usage algorithms remain owned by their source modules. Disable optional foreign analytics instead of importing t3 telemetry."
