      ],
      "reason": "Pure application-access facade delegates original management/execution. Existing public schema/instance identity remain. Profile list/select/remove use original CodexChatGptAuth schema/locks/revocation and controller invalidation with real PM ownership, not the removed local OAuth/runtime implementation."
    },
    {
      "id": "PM-CODEX-OPERATION-NATIVE-EVIDENCE",
