        "apps/server/src/provider/Drivers/CodexDriver.ts",
        "../../apps/server/agent/src/providers/drivers/codex-persistence.ts"
      ],
      "reason": "Existing Home inherits CODEX_HOME and resolves relative paths against bound native cwd, not global process cwd. Managed Home retains existing PM-owned stateDirectory through CodexManagedHomePath; installer retains old .managed-codex/runtime. A source-instance WeakMap gives maintenance the same installer/leases held by the original managed runtime. Startup-only conversion of old application-private managed profiles preserves native registration/hostId, refuses divergent new records, writes a private marker and never reads/imports global credentials. No installation-pointer rewrite is needed because original source schemas accept the existing package metadata."
